  "title": "India's Services Growth and Regional Economic Expansion",
  "summary": "India's services sector experienced broadened growth in June, with 18 out of 19 sub-sectors showing double-digit expansion, while real estate led at 24.7%. Air transport contraction was noted, but infrastructure and technology sectors saw strong performance, reflecting broader regional and global economic trends.",
  "facts": [
